{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己硬撑后，发现自己舍不得的不是一时舒服，而是曾真心相信过的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"相信过的生活\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼着人与人亲近时不必时时防着受伤，珍惜的东西也不必靠争抢才能留住。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必时时防着受伤\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"难过不用向别人解释，付出只因喜欢，也不用反复证明自己值得被爱和接纳。\",\n      \"key\": \"付出只因喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想把这份向往说成软弱。\",\n      \"key\": \"说成软弱\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他只想先珍惜这份向往，不急着问能不能实现，也不拿责任来衡量它有没有用。\",\n      \"key\": \"先珍惜这份向往\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他刚肯承认这份向往时还有些迟疑，后来不再逼自己装坚强，委屈和思念渐渐浮上来，渴望也越发迫切。\",\n      \"key\": \"渴望也越发迫切\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他重新感到满足，心也柔软下来，疲惫暂时淡去，一时不想把心思拉回现实，可那种生活仍没来到。\",\n      \"key\": \"不想拉回现实\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R24\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把生硬的催逼停止改成他不再逼自己硬撑，保留停止自我催逼后认出真正依恋的生活这一心理关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\", \"S06-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"去重\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-2明确保留亲近时不必预备受伤、珍贵之物不必靠争抢留住；S06-3删去重复的防备，只保留难过不必解释、付出只因喜欢和不必证明自己值得被爱。争抢的愿望改由S02-3提供前因，不再使用解释不充分的S03-2箭头。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\", \"R28\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简\",\n      \"why\": \"亲近曾带来快乐已经在S04-2说过，不再重复过去的体验，只留下他不想把这份向往说成软弱，并由S04-2提供理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R29\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"用平常话保留他暂时只想珍惜这份向往，不急着问能否实现，也不拿责任衡量它有没有用，避免连续罗列审查项目。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5356a614-4753-4ad4-9847-8011b2cc6a21", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T001843461359Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.062, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:20:37.540320+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8c18158488fab3a5f1fb90a4361f20babe8b2e5035f8a424f65f52a7d42fcc1c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422230